{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜立法會交通事務委員會檢討隧道分時段收費成效／北角社區客廳開幕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261120.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會交通事務委員會今日(11月20)開會討論三條過海隧道及大欖隧道分時段收費成效檢討。另外，政務司司長陳國基主持北角社區客廳開幕典禮，勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡將一同主禮。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:24:09.651339+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:39:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:40.626568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:17:30.454163+00:00","content_hash":"44482d8b918cd9bb44e90c2bccd1fefc5958edf02085020bc43b1c7f2429a5b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}